-   **total_cost_estimate_5yr_usd**: As a premium BMW diesel, the 5-year cost of ownership will be higher than average due to purchase price, depreciation, insurance, maintenance (including AdBlue refills), and potential repairs. Likely above $40,000. Scores negatively.
